From e166ecab237d9e78ddf5ca56a3c983e8df6cb8d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: beau4201 <beau.ten.berge@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:26:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] oblivios: the stage of an authorized switch, the decoy's
 launcher look and theme colours

Squash of former patches:

- 0037 oblivios: keep the wallpaper on screen behind the exit of an authorized switch with an empty stage window
- 0038 oblivios: write the owner's launcher look to the decoy before its home starts, and remove the lock-time launcher warm start
- 0039 oblivios: read the shape of the launcher look as a string, gate its warnings to debuggable builds and read the owner's look off the lock settings handler
- 0040 oblivios: hold the decoy home start on a static gate in services.jar, not on new methods of ActivityManagerInternal (framework.jar)
- 0041 oblivios: give the Duress decoy the outgoing user's wallpaper colours until its own arrive, so its theme follows the wallpaper
- 0042 oblivios: keep the wallpaper through an authorized switch (window manager hold) and draw it under the exit with the stage window
- 0043 oblivios: keep the stage window of an authorized switch shown while it is redrawn
- 0044 oblivios: load the stage wallpaper like the engine, cover the whole screen and keep the stage until the incoming home has drawn
- 0045 oblivios: signal the stage by a broadcast to SystemUI only, not a persisted setting, and gate its warnings to debuggable builds
